--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,6 +1,12 @@
 ## [Unreleased]

-### Fixed
+### Added
+
+- Library settings offer a cover grid for the full library, with 3, 4, or 5 books per row, on-demand SD thumbnail caching, and bounded numeric paging.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Library opens its saved index without an unconditional cold-boot scan and caches folder offsets for book lookups. Transfers and on-device file changes still refresh the index; use Refresh after copying books directly to the SD card.

 - Image refresh blanks each image separately, keeping text between inline images visible while images are prepared for display. Pending images use an empty background instead of a temporary box border.

