+++ b/docs/data-cache.md
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 ---

 # Data Cache
+
+Library settings allow 3, 4, or 5 books per row (9, 16, or 25 covers per page). Cover grid thumbnails are generated only for visible EPUB/XTC books and reused from their existing per-book disk caches. Books without covers use a placeholder; confirmed missing EPUB covers are remembered in `library-cover-missing`. Text files use a placeholder. Library opens the saved index on startup; after directly editing the SD card, use Library → Refresh. Transfers and on-device file changes invalidate the index automatically. No cache format change or cache deletion is needed.

 CrossInk caches data aggressively on the SD card to minimize RAM use. The ESP32-C3 has about 380 KB of usable RAM, so rebuilding every book structure in memory on every open would be too expensive.

